    "sub_name": "數位社會創新實作",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF DIGITAL SOCIAL INNOVATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培育學生具備因應社會事業進行創新與數位轉型之能力，透過系上教師與跨領域業師之參與，課程設計將導入企業實務命題，以工作坊形式進行實作，針對社會事業的創新與數位轉型提出解決方案。",
    "describe_eh": " This course intends to foster students’ capability in social innovation and digital transformation. Through joint teaching of our faculties and industrial lecturers and workshop participation, this course is a problem-based learning course, in which students need to propose potential and feasible solutions for the digital transformation and business innovation of social enterprises.",
